{"title": "[新聞] 川普：將不會允許公司在美國境外建造資", "author": "storyb181 (storyb111)", "board": "", "date": "Sat Nov 21 20:25:48 2026", "url": "https://www.ptt.cc/bbs/Stock/M.1795263951.A.466.html", "body": "文章標題 請使用 原新聞標題 勿刪減或自創標題，違者4-1處分\n\n原文標題：\n Trump says he will not allow companies to build data centers outside\nUS\n\n原文連結：\n\nhttps://reurl.cc/k9mrvd\n\n發布時間：\n2026/11/21\n\n記者署名：\n路透社（白宮簡報）\n\nhttps://i.imgur.com/bPM1COs.jpeg\n\n原文內容：\nVideo shows: Soundbites from U.S. President Donald Trump inside the Wh\nite House briefing room\n\nShows: Washington, D.C., United States (November 20, 2026) (Reuters - Access all\n)\n\nPresident Donald Trump entering briefing room followed by Vice President JD Vanc\ne and Secretary of State Marco Rubio\n(Soundbite) (English) U.S. President Donald Trump saying:\n\"The data centers - and we're going to fight very hard for the data centers beca\nuse we're not going to let China - we're leading China. In fact, President Xi co\nngratulated me on how well we're doing in every way, but also with superintellig\nence. He likes that name too, by the way. He likes it better. As he said, it's m\nore accurate. It is super. It's not artificial intelligence. It's not artificial\n. It's super. Problem is it may be too super. So President Xi and I agree that w\ne're going to do some joint guardrails, the two of us, because there really is n\no third place. I mean, we are so leading. We're leading, and they're second. And\n there's nobody even close after that. I don't think there ever will be. But who\never wins, SI wins. Remember that. Whoever wins, SI wins, and you ought to take\nadvantage of the data centers. Make them pay you. Make them pay your community,\nbut take advantage. Don't shut them off. And there's always somebody else in thi\ns country. But if it's not this country, there's somebody else outside. And we'r\ne not going to allow our companies to build data centers outside of our country.\n We're not going to allow that to happen. You know, they allowed that to happen\nwith chips and everything else. It was very destructive to our country. It's whe\nre we started going behind.\"\n\nTrump speaking\n\n翻譯\n\n節目：美國華盛頓特區（2026年11月20日）（路透社-全部訪問）\n\n唐納德·川普總統進入簡報室，副總統JD Vance和國務卿Marco Rubio緊隨其後\n（Soundbite）（英語）美國 唐納德·川普總統說：\n「資料中心——我們將為資料中心努力奮鬥，因為我們不會讓中國——我們主管著中國。\n事實上，習主席祝賀我，我們在各方面都做得很好，而且還有超智慧。 順便說一句，他也\n喜歡這個名字。 他更喜歡它。 正如他所說，它更準確。 超級棒。 這不是人工智慧。 這\n不是人為的。 太棒了。 問題是它可能太超級了。 因此，習主席和我同意，我們兩個人將\n做一些聯合護欄，因為真的沒有第三名。 我的意思是，我們太領先了。 我們領先，他們排\n在第二位。 在那之後，甚至沒有人靠近。 我認為永遠不會有。 但誰贏了SI就贏了。 記住\n那個。\n 無論誰贏了SI都贏了，你應該利用資料中心的優勢。 讓他們付錢給你。 讓他們支\n\n付你的社區，但要利用。 不要關閉它們。\n 這個國家總有其他人。 但如果不是這個國家，\n外面還有別人。\n我們不會允許我們的公司在國外建立資料中心。 我們不會允許這種情況發\n\n生。 你知道，他們允許晶片和其他東西發生這種情況。 這對我們的國家非常具有破壞性。\n\n 這是我們開始落後的地方。」\n\n特朗普講話\n\n心得/評論：\n\n我覺得這是爆炸性的利空新聞，但古板沒有人討論，總結來說川普知道SI的重要性，但因為\n現在\n民主黨上台限制了資料中心的建置\n，所以他上面才會\n喊話要人民與資料中心共存並創造\n\n雙贏\n。\n但話鋒一轉川普突然想到既然你民主黨要擋資料中心的建置，那我身為偉大的美國總統，為\n了龐大的美國利益著想，那我\n乾脆把所有國外的資料中心建置都喊停\n。\n但台灣人就是靠賣資料中心鏟子賺到大筆大筆的鈔票的呀，這樣一停？台股是不是真的完蛋\n了。\n\n滿30正體中文字\n，心得過短或濫竽充數將以板規 1-2-3 處分\n\n--\nSent from my iPhone 16 Pro\n\nPiTT\n//\nPHJCI", "comments": [{"tag": "噓", "user": "kenbo", "content": "還好我們還有限空令3.0不怕", "time": "11/21 20:26"}, {"tag": "→", "user": "MizPerfect", "content": "https://iili.io/oFy5rQI.jpg", "time": "11/21 20:26"}, {"tag": "推", "user": "A80211ab", "content": "那本土也不給蓋 算力回歸人腦就好", "time": "11/21 20:26"}, {"tag": "→", "user": "MizPerfect", "content": "好啊! 大家都不要玩AI! 台股回到三千 謝謝", "time": "11/21 20:27"}, {"tag": "→", "user": "wang56", "content": "美國企業成本會變很高，美國勞工不像台灣勞工這麼好", "time": "11/21 20:27"}, {"tag": "→", "user": "wang56", "content": "剝削，願意高工時低薪一直做到老", "time": "11/21 20:27"}, {"tag": "推", "user": "sss870192", "content": "本土不能蓋海外也不能 撞到頭ㄛ XDDDDD", "time": "11/21 20:27"}, {"tag": "噓", "user": "q43128", "content": "這樣叫AI泡沫？", "time": "11/21 20:27"}, {"tag": "推", "user": "jl834021", "content": "等著看TACO", "time": "11/21 20:28"}, {"tag": "推", "user": "sdbb", "content": "馬斯克：蛤？", "time": "11/21 20:28"}, {"tag": "推", "user": "hate56", "content":